<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-062-B habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.315914" lon="-120.908121"><name>SC26-062-B</name><cmt>SC26-062</cmt><desc>Morro Bay rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 6.0 m relief across 210 m. Terrain B 59/100; not catch probability. Center 141 ft; nearby 137–158 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Parallel bands visible in survey rendering; confirm small-scale relief by sonar. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9HEZNRO"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-046</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.32269489393246" lon="-120.91185108069594"/><trkpt lat="35.32251657439311" lon="-120.91196566355019"/><trkpt lat="35.322437860062195" lon="-120.91262766399515"/><trkpt lat="35.322259539707765" lon="-120.9127422447887"/><trkpt lat="35.32226713407846" lon="-120.91318203256857"/><trkpt lat="35.322090711373676" lon="-120.91340655864784"/><trkpt lat="35.32119151289861" lon="-120.91353966419872"/><trkpt lat="35.321187716663324" lon="-120.91331977315023"/><trkpt lat="35.320827278029995" lon="-120.91332903735828"/><trkpt lat="35.320750453223354" lon="-120.91410096797068"/><trkpt lat="35.322006295799326" lon="-120.91373871460436"/><trkpt lat="35.3220119889736" lon="-120.91406855460497"/><trkpt lat="35.321651550217375" lon="-120.9140778157721